{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>Therefore an enemy</b> — that an enemy shall surround Samaria and the environs of the land, so that none who goes out from it shall escape." "<b>And he shall bring down</b> — the besieger shall bring down and flatten the stronghold, and the men of the siege shall plunder all the palaces mentioned, for they are full of violence."], :book :amos, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Amos -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/amos"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:17:54.837241455Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}